[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14341.55, "timestamp": "03:59:01", "text": "我只能抽出几分钟时间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14345.429, "timestamp": "03:59:05", "text": "一切。对，就是这样。你好，Kayan"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14349.11, "timestamp": "03:59:09", "text": "尼基萨。你好。还有，你好啊，呃，死去的玩家"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14351.75, "timestamp": "03:59:11", "text": "66. 欢迎光临。谢谢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14354.07, "timestamp": "03:59:14", "text": "补水。你好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14356.389, "timestamp": "03:59:16", "text": "你好。哦，我们要补充水分。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14360.79, "timestamp": "03:59:20", "text": "然后。是的。你好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14362.55, "timestamp": "03:59:22", "text": "我意识到是时候停下来了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14364.309, "timestamp": "03:59:24", "text": "拖延了一段时间后，终于上传了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14367.75, "timestamp": "03:59:27", "text": "终于上传了一些内容。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14370.309, "timestamp": "03:59:30", "text": "真的。那是我能做到的一件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14373.429, "timestamp": "03:59:33", "text": "通过 Joathon 完成。我能够"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14375.99, "timestamp": "03:59:35", "text": "至少发个视频什么的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14379.189, "timestamp": "03:59:39", "text": "作为短篇内容"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14381.99, "timestamp": "03:59:41", "text": "对，还有短裤之类的。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14383.67, "timestamp": "03:59:43", "text": "你知道，照片拍得挺不错的。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14385.03, "timestamp": "03:59:45", "text": "说实话，这些照片拍得真不错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14387.349, "timestamp": "03:59:47", "text": "好的。虽然感觉就像真的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14390.07, "timestamp": "03:59:50", "text": "基本款，未经编辑之类的，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14391.67, "timestamp": "03:59:51", "text": "仍然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14393.99, "timestamp": "03:59:53", "text": "至少能上传文件感觉真好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14395.67, "timestamp": "03:59:55", "text": "与其继续下去，不如做点别的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time"